{
  "id": "street-directions",
  "title": "街上問路",
  "titleEn": "Asking for Directions",
  "category": "出行與交通",
  "level": "初級至初中級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/street-directions.webp",
    "alt": "Leo 拿著手機在街道人行道上向一名女子問路；女子指向前方，遠處可見紅綠燈、銀行與車站。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo stops on a neighborhood "
        },
        {
          "text": "street",
          "wordIds": [
            "street"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and checks his "
        },
        {
          "text": "phone",
          "wordIds": [
            "phone"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 在一條街區道路上停下來，查看手機。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/street-directions/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "b6f5428869970e39ac3c9625a65d679fab9eaa09de5fd89663c80f7a5281fe79",
        "sha256": "dccebf15c373f300b574d75108ef4b651355f73d961301722318e7da3edf8864"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He asks a "
        },
        {
          "text": "woman",
          "wordIds": [
            "woman"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", “"
        },
        {
          "text": "How do I get to the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "how-to-get-to-station"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "station",
          "phraseIds": [
            "how-to-get-to-station"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "station"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "how-to-get-to-station"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他問一位女子：「請問車站怎麼走？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/street-directions/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "d3bd3ee39a7b0d3c7f799969184e7150ca1f3f46ea79acc7dcd98c07c4385cc4",
        "sha256": "f46e90f2c68812bf6b3a314889f5830000a905c6b0f5f8edbbd4e9c7e5ef7212"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "Go ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "go-straight"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "straight",
          "phraseIds": [
            "go-straight"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "straight"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " along this "
        },
        {
          "text": "street",
          "wordIds": [
            "street"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",” she says, pointing ahead."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "她指向前方說：「沿著這條街直走。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/street-directions/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "a1bf1a0f23ac96459269b5a8575340c92180ba7de59dc4a0d20a153a51856f76",
        "sha256": "39017efeb006b8c431276acb2fe68adb987daf7947045cef7030efb5badb12c9"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Then "
        },
        {
          "text": "turn ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "turn-left-at-light"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "left",
          "phraseIds": [
            "turn-left-at-light"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "left"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " at the traffic light",
          "phraseIds": [
            "turn-left-at-light"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「然後在紅綠燈左轉。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/street-directions/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "24f7898568900c9a245cb692c232d61b225dd82c3e039c252aa25ac59aab4a2a",
        "sha256": "81896cf1a5d72dbdcd317e84047fd32d3caabea690ddfb7b0647cfc9cc6dc15f"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“The "
        },
        {
          "text": "station",
          "wordIds": [
            "station"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is "
        },
        {
          "text": "next to the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "next-to-bank"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bank",
          "phraseIds": [
            "next-to-bank"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "bank"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「車站就在銀行旁邊。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/street-directions/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "dc8e5ec9a9e191d949254c0f2c06d4351289c2499b43b429f235956d252967a6",
        "sha256": "85bd5a19e3de604af4e2ed6915e1f344ff8a3f9d022ebf503365825351d697d4"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“It's about "
        },
        {
          "text": "a five-minute ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "five-minute-walk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "walk",
          "phraseIds": [
            "five-minute-walk"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "walk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " from here.”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「從這裡走過去大約五分鐘。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/street-directions/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "32e31c66918acbce6ef99c994a76981447030dd3a877f3560367c2f9ba897d43",
        "sha256": "fef5428fb70a377af0f6eae7bf0b8707d46398bde6f14dfe3321b1ecafdf91e8"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Thank you for your help,” Leo says."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 說：「謝謝妳幫忙。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/street-directions/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "d27a76dd68e80bceaa77b7eed28bab4815853653258f3e93f7864f1560abad77",
        "sha256": "192d83e533d0a6e4f0afc17760ce6384f4f5072819fcb06b6dc2e4003953d4b2"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He puts away his "
        },
        {
          "text": "phone",
          "wordIds": [
            "phone"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and starts walking."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他收起手機，開始往車站走。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/street-directions/8.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "440e90bc0d493afde96c1d472aa1849ad4c2d2996104ad5104a862355651a2db",
        "sha256": "5e8c042302f13d7c4ab8c838bdd3c3386cfa0455d83bc15b088bf46e95bd08a9"
      }
    }
  ],
